	quest.151F3F18F0D37071.quest_desc: [
		"The Electric Blast Furnace is a 3x3x4 multiblock with heat coils in the middle two layers. Coils decide the maximum heat: cupronickel reaches 1800°, kanthal 2400°."
		""
		"Hot ingots come out and need the Vacuum Freezer to cool."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Electric Blast Furnace and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
