	quest.1C2AF6CF3F65EF2C.quest_desc: [
		"The Electric Age is where MI speeds up. Machines now run on power (LV first, then MV and HV), and multiblocks get much bigger."
		""
		"§eHow power works:§r generators make power at a voltage. Machines need that voltage or they won't run, so use the right cable (tin for LV, copper for MV, and so on) or a transformer. Start by making a couple of motors."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 2 x Motor and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1C2AF6CF3F65EF2C.title: "Electricity"
